    "Reserve a Table": "预订座位",
    "At One More, experience the legacy of Cambodian cuisine through Chef Hor Chanthorn's 15 years of experience, vision, and passion, which shape every dish on our menu. His commitment to preserving and elevating Cambodian cuisine ensures an unparalleled culinary journey for all who dine with us.": "在 One More，Chef Hor Chanthorn 凭借 15 年经验、独到视野与满腔热情，将柬埔寨美食的传承融入菜单中的每一道菜。他致力于守护并提升柬埔寨料理，为每位宾客带来独一无二的味觉之旅。",
    "At One More, experience the legacy of Cambodian cuisine through Chef Khna Ra's 10 years of experience. His commitment to preserving and elevating Cambodian cuisine ensures an unparalleled culinary journey for all who dine with us.": "在 One More，Chef Khna Ra 凭借 10 年经验，带您领略柬埔寨美食的传承。他致力于守护并提升柬埔寨料理，为每位宾客带来独一无二的味觉之旅。",
